('wikiloc', '242122365', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/garrigoles-ermita-de-sant-grau-puig-segalar-castell-de-sant-feliu-de-la-garriga-palau-borrell-garri-242122365', 'Garrigoles - Ermita de Sant Grau - Puig Segalar - Castell de Sant Feliu de la Garriga - Palau Borrell - Garrigoles', '{"en":"Garrigoles loop via Sant Grau and Palau Borrell","ca":"Circular de Garrigoles per Sant Grau i Palau Borrell","es":"Circular de Garrigoles por Sant Grau y Palau Borrell"}'::jsonb, 'Garrigoles - Ermita de Sant Grau - Puig Segalar - Castell de Sant Feliu de la Garriga - Palau Borrell - Garrigoles Hiking trail in Garrigoles, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the route on a map. Record your own itinerary from the Wikiloc app, upload the trail and share it with the community.', '{"en":"This moderate 11.8 km loop trail with 227m of elevation gain starts and ends in Garrigoles. The route leads hikers through a varied landscape, combining natural paths with cultural landmarks.\n\nKey points of interest include the Ermita de Sant Grau, the summit of Puig Segalar, the historical Castell de Sant Feliu de la Garriga, and the charming village of Palau Borrell. This trail offers a balanced experience of gentle ascents and descents, suitable for a pleasant day out exploring the region''s heritage and views.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada d''11,8 km amb 227m de desnivell comença i acaba a Garrigoles. La ruta condueix els excursionistes per un paisatge variat, combinant camins naturals amb llocs d''interès cultural.\n\nEls punts clau d''interès inclouen l''Ermita de Sant Grau, el cim del Puig Segalar, l''històric Castell de Sant Feliu de la Garriga i l''encantador poble de Palau Borrell. Aquesta ruta ofereix una experiència equilibrada d''ascensos i descensos suaus, adequada per a una agradable jornada explorant el patrimoni i les vistes de la regió.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 11,8 km con 227m de desnivel comienza y termina en Garrigoles. La ruta lleva a los excursionistas a través de un paisaje variado, combinando caminos naturales con puntos de interés cultural.\n\nLos puntos clave de interés incluyen la Ermita de Sant Grau, la cumbre del Puig Segalar, el histórico Castell de Sant Feliu de la Garriga y el encantador pueblo de Palau Borrell. Este sendero ofrece una experiencia equilibrada de suaves ascensos y descensos, adecuada para un agradable día explorando el patrimonio y las vistas de la región."}'::jsonb, 'bemc73@hotmail.com', 11845, 227, 227, 175, 46, 'moderate', 'loop', 9360, 10380, 1877, '2025-11-29', '2025-10', '[{"lat":42.107244,"lng":3.030314,"ele":88},{"lat":42.107243,"lng":3.030235,"ele":87.7},{"lat":42.107245,"lng":3.030302,"ele":88},{"lat":42.107291,"lng":3.030336,"ele":88},{"lat":42.107324,"lng":3.030391,"ele":88},{"lat":42.107339,"lng":3.030451,"ele":88},{"lat":42.107354,"lng":3.030521,"ele":88},{"lat":42.107349,"lng":3.030596,"ele":87.7},{"lat":42.107358,"lng":3.030662,"ele":87.2},{"lat":42.107363,"lng":3.030725,"ele":86.8},{"lat":42.107394,"lng":3.030778,"ele":86.6},{"lat":42.107421,"lng":3.030854,"ele":86.3},{"lat":42.107449,"lng":3.030918,"ele":86.1},{"lat":42.107498,"lng":3.030923,"ele":86.3},{"lat":42.107544,"lng":3.030934,"ele":86.3},{"lat":42.107602,"lng":3.030946,"ele":86.2},{"lat":42.107649,"lng":3.030967,"ele":86},{"lat":42.107699,"lng":3.030986,"ele":85.9},{"lat":42.107748,"lng":3.031001,"ele":85.8},{"lat":42.107745,"lng":3.03107,"ele":85.3},{"lat":42.107786,"lng":3.03111,"ele":85},{"lat":42.107832,"lng":3.031117,"ele":85},{"lat":42.107883,"lng":3.031102,"ele":85.1},{"lat":42.107938,"lng":3.031108,"ele":85},{"lat":42.107987,"lng":3.031115,"ele":85},{"lat":42.108025,"lng":3.031162,"ele":84.8},{"lat":42.108053,"lng":3.031216,"ele":84.6},{"lat":42.108078,"lng":3.031273,"ele":84.6},{"lat":42.108107,"lng":3.031326,"ele":84.6},{"lat":42.108123,"lng":3.031398,"ele":84.4},{"lat":42.108128,"lng":3.03146,"ele":84.1},{"lat":42.108155,"lng":3.031525,"ele":83.9},{"lat":42.108176,"lng":3.03158