-“Puig d’Arques per Torrent de Can Bancells, Mina d’en Nadal, St Cebrià dels Alls, Dólmen de Puig d’Arques i Saplà de Mas Sàbat” 
ca.wikiloc.com/rutes-senderisme/puig-darques-per-torrent-de-can-bancells-mina-den-nadal-st-cebria-dels-alls-dolmen-de-puig-darques-260331786', '{"en":"This moderate 12.6 km loop with 546m of elevation gain starts from Can Llaurador in Solius, accessible via a dirt track from the C-65. The route offers an adventurous journey, passing the Menhir de Can Llaurador and the artificial Cova de Sa Tuna before tackling the Carcaixells, which include easy equipped sections and an optional visit to the hanging bridge of Pas dels Aritjols.\n\nThe trail then ascends Puig Montclar, visits the degraded Sant Baldiri church, and passes the Menhir del Terme Gros before reaching Puig de les Cols, an exceptional viewpoint. The return leg follows the ridge past Roca Verdera and Puig Basart, concluding at the impressive Pedralta rock and its chapel.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 12,6 km amb 546m de desnivell comença des de Can Llaurador a Solius, accessible per una pista de terra des de la C-65. La ruta ofereix un viatge aventurer, passant pel Menhir de Can Llaurador i la cova artificial de Sa Tuna abans d''afrontar els Carcaixells, que inclouen trams equipats fàcils i una visita opcional al pont penjant del Pas dels Aritjols.\n\nEl sender ascendeix després al Puig Montclar, visita l''església degradada de Sant Baldiri i passa pel Menhir del Terme Gros abans d''arribar al Puig de les Cols, un mirador excepcional. El tram de tornada segueix la carena passant per la Roca Verdera i el Puig Basart, concloent a la impressionant roca de la Pedralta i la seva capella.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 12,6 km con 546m de desnivel comienza desde Can Llaurador en Solius, accesible por una pista de tierra desde la C-65. La ruta ofrece un viaje aventurero, pasando por el Menhir de Can Llaurador y la cueva artificial de Sa Tuna antes de abordar los Carcaixells, que incluyen tramos equipados fáciles y una visita opcional al puente colgante del Pas dels Aritjols.\n\nEl sendero asciende luego al Puig Montclar, visita la degradada iglesia de Sant Baldiri y pasa por el Menhir del Terme Gros antes de llegar al Puig de les Cols, un mirador excepcional. El tramo de regreso sigue la carena pasando por la Roca Verdera y el Puig Basart, concluyendo en la impresionante roca de la Pedralta y su capilla."}'::jsonb, 'Aventura''t', 12601, 546, 546, 401, 58, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 24300, 1558, '2018-04-22', '2018-02', '[{"lat":41.809164,"lng":2.972824,"ele":58.3},{"lat":41.809155,"lng":2.972825,"ele":58.4},{"lat":41.809112,"lng":2.972807,"ele":58.4},{"lat":41.809071,"lng":2.972799,"ele":58.5},{"lat":41.808963,"lng":2.972777,"ele":58.7},{"lat":41.808899,"lng":2.972762,"ele":59},{"lat":41.808682,"lng":2.972764,"ele":61.9},{"lat":41.808497,"lng":2.972799,"ele":63.2},{"lat":41.808311,"lng":2.972818,"ele":63.3},{"lat":41.808255,"lng":2.972822,"ele":63.4},{"lat":41.808106,"lng":2.972836,"ele":63.6},{"lat":41.807925,"lng":2.972851,"ele":65.7},{"lat":41.807783,"lng":2.972869,"ele":67.9},{"lat":41.807659,"lng":2.972837,"ele":68.7},{"lat":41.807631,"lng":2.97283,"ele":69},{"lat":41.807596,"lng":2.972805,"ele":69.1},{"lat":41.807576,"lng":2.972779,"ele":69.2},{"lat":41.807576,"lng":2.972779,"ele":69.2},{"lat":41.807563,"lng":2.972755,"ele":69.2},{"lat":41.807544,"lng":2.972725,"ele":69.1},{"lat":41.807411,"lng":2.972522,"ele":69.1},{"lat":41.807318,"lng":2.97239,"ele":69.6},{"lat":41.807296,"lng":2.972366,"ele":69.7},{"lat":41.807114,"lng":2.972185,"ele":70.2},{"lat":41.80701,"lng":2.972066,"ele":70.1},{"lat":41.806906,"lng":2.971935,"ele":69.9},{"lat":41.806719,"lng":2.971582,"ele":69.4},{"lat":41.806541,"lng":2.971272,"ele":70.3},{"lat":41.80653,"lng":2.971248,"ele":70.5},{"lat":41.80651,"lng":2.971205,"ele":70.8},{"lat":41.806442,"lng":2.971102,"ele":71.7},{"lat":41.806268,"lng":2.97084,"ele":74},{"lat":41.806114,"lng":2.97068,"ele":74},{"lat":41.805944,"lng":2.970621,"ele":73.9},{"lat":41.805781,"lng":2.970522,"ele":74.4},{"lat":41.805684,"lng":2.970376,"ele":75.8},