('wikiloc', '243135791', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/agulla-del-corb-i-roc-de-cogul-des-de-peramola-243135791', 'Agulla del Corb i Roc de Cogul des de Peramola', '{"en":"Peramola circular, Agulla del Corb included","ca":"Circular Peramola, amb Agulla del Corb","es":"Circular Peramola, con Agulla del Corb"}'::jsonb, 'Agulla del Corb i Roc de Cogul des de Peramola Hiking trail in Peramola, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Ruta sortint de l''àrea d''autocaravanes de Peramola, passant per les ruïnes de Casa Nerola, el grau de Porta i el coll de Quatre Camins, inici de l''espectacular circuit de les Roques del Corb, passant pel Forat del Corb, el mirador, l''ermita de Sant Salvador i l''Agulla del Corb, el corral i la Casa del Corb i un senzill tram equipat amb cadenes. Situats de nou al coll de Quatre Camins, retorn al poble de Peramola després d''assolir el Roc de Cogul (100 Cims).', '{"en":"This moderate 10.4 km loop begins from the motorhome area in Peramola, leading through the ruins of Casa Nerola and the Grau de Porta. It then enters the spectacular circuit of the Roques del Corb.\n\nThe route passes through Forat del Corb, a viewpoint, the hermitage of Sant Salvador, and the Agulla del Corb, featuring a simple section equipped with chains. After reaching Roc de Cogul, the trail returns to Peramola, with a total elevation gain of 554m.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 10.4 km comença des de l''àrea d''autocaravanes de Peramola, passant per les ruïnes de Casa Nerola i el Grau de Porta. Després s''endinsa en l''espectacular circuit de les Roques del Corb.\n\nLa ruta passa pel Forat del Corb, un mirador, l''ermita de Sant Salvador i l''Agulla del Corb, amb un senzill tram equipat amb cadenes. Després d''assolir el Roc de Cogul, el sender retorna a Peramola, amb un desnivell acumulat de 554m.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 10.4 km comienza desde el área de autocaravanas de Peramola, pasando por las ruinas de Casa Nerola y el Grau de Porta. Luego se adentra en el espectacular circuito de las Roques del Corb.\n\nLa ruta pasa por el Forat del Corb, un mirador, la ermita de Sant Salvador y la Agulla del Corb, con un sencillo tramo equipado con cadenas. Después de alcanzar el Roc de Cogul, el sendero regresa a Peramola, con un desnivel acumulado de 554m."}'::jsonb, 'Joan i Carme', 10380, 554, 554, 949, 529, 'moderate', 'loop', 12240, 18660, 1873, '2025-12-07', '2025-11', '[{"lat":42.062019,"lng":1.275344,"ele":545.1},{"lat":42.06203,"lng":1.275273,"ele":534},{"lat":42.062056,"lng":1.275217,"ele":534},{"lat":42.062081,"lng":1.27516,"ele":534.2},{"lat":42.062105,"lng":1.2751,"ele":535.2},{"lat":42.062127,"lng":1.275047,"ele":535.4},{"lat":42.062155,"lng":1.274996,"ele":536.7},{"lat":42.062173,"lng":1.274937,"ele":537.2},{"lat":42.062201,"lng":1.274879,"ele":537.5},{"lat":42.062227,"lng":1.274829,"ele":537.6},{"lat":42.062251,"lng":1.274774,"ele":538.3},{"lat":42.062262,"lng":1.274712,"ele":539.5},{"lat":42.062281,"lng":1.274654,"ele":540.4},{"lat":42.062293,"lng":1.274589,"ele":541.9},{"lat":42.062254,"lng":1.274548,"ele":542.9},{"lat":42.062202,"lng":1.274524,"ele":542.8},{"lat":42.062156,"lng":1.274513,"ele":543.6},{"lat":42.062104,"lng":1.274495,"ele":544.2},{"lat":42.062058,"lng":1.274488,"ele":544.2},{"lat":42.062008,"lng":1.27448,"ele":544.1},{"lat":42.061955,"lng":1.274467,"ele":544.3},{"lat":42.061904,"lng":1.274459,"ele":544.6},{"lat":42.061855,"lng":1.274454,"ele":545.5},{"lat":42.061812,"lng":1.274434,"ele":547},{"lat":42.06177,"lng":1.274404,"ele":547.2},{"lat":42.061723,"lng":1.274367,"ele":547.8},{"lat":42.061698,"lng":1.274316,"ele":548.1},{"lat":42.061661,"lng":1.274278,"ele":548.7},{"lat":42.06162,"lng":1.274236,"ele":549.2},{"lat":42.061583,"lng":1.274189,"ele":548.5},{"lat":42.06155,"lng":1.274134,"ele":548.2},{"lat":42.061519,"lng":1.274088,"ele":548.3},{"lat":42.061487,"lng":1.274038,"ele":548.1},{"lat":42.061477,"lng":1.273969,"ele":548},{"lat"