.................................................', '{"en":"This easy 7.2 km loop starts in Collbató, specifically from Carrer Cavall Bernat, and ascends 126 meters to the Turó de Can Dolcet. The summit, at 416 meters, features a geodesic vertex.\n\nThe route is suitable for a relaxed outing, offering a gentle climb through the natural surroundings between Collbató and Hostalets de Pierola. It''s a straightforward path for those looking for a short, accessible hike.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular fàcil de 7.2 km comença a Collbató, concretament des del Carrer Cavall Bernat, i puja 126 metres fins al Turó de Can Dolcet. El cim, a 416 metres, inclou un vèrtex geodèsic.\n\nEl recorregut és adequat per a una sortida relaxada, oferint una pujada suau a través de l''entorn natural entre Collbató i Hostalets de Pierola. És un camí senzill per a aquells que busquen una caminada curta i accessible.","es":"Esta ruta circular fácil de 7.2 km comienza en Collbató, específicamente desde la Calle Cavall Bernat, y asciende 126 metros hasta el Turó de Can Dolcet. La cima, a 416 metros, cuenta con un vértice geodésico.\n\nEl recorrido es adecuado para una salida relajada, ofreciendo una subida suave a través del entorno natural entre Collbató y Hostalets de Pierola. Es un camino sencillo para quienes buscan una caminata corta y accesible."}'::jsonb, 'Willy Fogg', 7178, 126, 126, 415, 289, 'easy', 'loop', NULL, 9600, 615, '2025-12-17', '2025-11', '[{"lat":41.560595,"lng":1.817686,"ele":312.5},{"lat":41.560597,"lng":1.817687,"ele":312.5},{"lat":41.560597,"lng":1.817686,"ele":312.5},{"lat":41.560586,"lng":1.817644,"ele":312.5},{"lat":41.560578,"lng":1.817534,"ele":312.5},{"lat":41.560575,"lng":1.817522,"ele":312.5},{"lat":41.560553,"lng":1.817486,"ele":312.5},{"lat":41.560426,"lng":1.817431,"ele":311.6},{"lat":41.560417,"lng":1.817428,"ele":311.6},{"lat":41.560407,"lng":1.817424,"ele":311.6},{"lat":41.560396,"lng":1.817421,"ele":311.6},{"lat":41.560385,"lng":1.81742,"ele":311.6},{"lat":4