English Version 
 
A moderate hike, both technically and physically demanding, consisting of a circular route from Sant Vicenç de Castellet to the Hostal de Sant Jaume de Vallhonesta, to discover the highlights of the architectural and natural heritage of this town in the Bages region. 
 
Points of interest: 
1- Masía Can Noguera 
2- Masía de Cal Miquel Gras 
3- Sant Bernat viewpoint 
4- San Pere de Vallhonesta Church 
5- Rectory of San Pere de Vallhonesta 
6- Robin Fountain 
7- Can Sala Farmhouse 
8- Cal Martí Farmhouse 
9- Cal Peret Carreres Farmhouse 
10- Cal Jeroni Farmhouse 
11- Cal Xacó Farmhouse 
