13- Ruins of Cal l''Anton 
14- Ca l''Ambròs farmhouse 
15- San Jaume de Vallhonesta Hostel 
16- Hermitage of San Jaume de Vallhonesta 
17- Fountain of San Jaume de Vallhonesta 
18- Summit of the Rock of San Jaume 
19- Ruins of La Serra 
20- Puigsoler Summit 
21- Summit of Puigsoler Petit 
 
Note 1: A GPS device is essential, or navigation must be enabled on the Wikiloc app. 
 
Note 2: The hike is not difficult to follow, but it is not suitable for those looking for very easy outings without having to use their GPS, as it is not a marked route and you must pay attention to your GPS at intersections. 
 
Note 3: The hiking time without stops is approximately 3 hours and 40 minutes. 
 
 
 
