-“Roca Sareny, Montcau i Cortins pel Castell Pera, Emprius, Queixal Corcat, Agulles de Finestrelles, Coves (8) i Canal del Llor” 
ca.wikiloc.com/rutes-senderisme/roca-sareny-montcau-i-cortins-pel-castell-pera-emprius-queixal-corcat-agulles-de-finestrelles-coves-206095146', '{"en":"This fantastic 16.6 km moderate loop, starting from the Casanova de l’Obac parking, offers an adventurous journey through the Sant Llorenç del Munt i l''Obac Natural Park. The route involves ascending several channels, some optional, to reach the panoramic summits of Castell de Bocs (662m), Roca Salvatge (777m), and Castellsapera (939m).\n\nThe trail also explores the Paller de Tot l’Any, skirts Turó Roig (681m), follows the Camí Ral and Serra del Pou ridges, and visits 18th-century ice wells, the Cova de la Canal del Solitàri, and the unique “Bores” of Forat dels Despistats. Expect varied terrain and historical points of interest.","ca":"Aquesta fantàstica ruta circular moderada de 16.6 km, amb inici des de l''aparcament de la Casanova de l’Obac, ofereix un viatge aventurer pel Parc Natural de Sant Llorenç del Munt i l''Obac. La ruta implica pujar diverses canals, algunes opcionals, per assolir els cims panoràmics del Castell de Bocs (662m), la Roca Salvatge (777m) i Castellsapera (939m).\n\nEl camí també explora el Paller de Tot l’Any, voreja el Turó Roig (681m), segueix les carenes del Camí Ral i de la Serra del Pou, i visita pous de glaç del segle XVIII, la Cova de la Canal del Solitàri i les curioses “Bores” del Forat dels Despistats. Espereu un terreny variat i punts d''interès històric.","es":"Esta fantástica ruta circular moderada de 16.6 km, con inicio desde el aparcamiento de la Casanova de l’Obac, ofrece un viaje aventurero por el Parque Natural de Sant Llorenç del Munt i l''Obac. La ruta implica ascender varias canales, algunas opcionales, para alcanzar las cumbres panorámicas del Castell de Bocs (662m), la Roca Salvatge (777m) y Castellsapera (939m).\n\nEl sendero también explora el Paller de Tot l’Any, bordea el Turó Roig (681m), sigue las crestas del Camí Ral y de la Serra del Pou, y visita pozos de hielo del siglo XVIII, la Cova de la Canal del Solitàri y las curiosas “Bores” del Forat dels Despistats. Espere un terreno variado y puntos de interés histórico."}'::jsonb, 'Aventura''t', 16641, 749, 749, 910, 450, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 24540, 1752, '2018-05-09', '2018-02', '[{"lat":41.621854,"lng":1.9549,"ele":657.4},{"lat":41.622073,"lng":1.954805,"ele":657},{"lat":41.622178,"lng":1.954745,"ele":657.1},{"lat":41.622155,"lng":1.954699,"ele":658.4},{"lat":41.622142,"lng":1.954688,"ele":658.8},{"lat":41.62206,"lng":1.954662,"ele":660.5},{"lat":41.62196,"lng":1.954613,"ele":663.1},{"lat":41.621851,"lng":1.95457,"ele":666.3},{"lat":41.621725,"lng":1.954533,"ele":669.8},{"lat":41.621708,"lng":1.954527,"ele":670.3},{"lat":41.621558,"lng":1.954487,"ele":671.4},{"lat":41.62151,"lng":1.954448,"ele":671.8},{"lat":41.621508,"lng":1.954418,"ele":671.9},{"lat":41.621496,"lng":1.954302,"ele":672.2},{"lat":41.621462,"lng":1.954152,"ele":671.9},{"lat":41.621467,"lng":1.954041,"ele":670.4},{"lat":41.621426,"lng":1.954009,"ele":669.3},{"lat":41.621426,"lng":1.953973,"ele":668.8},{"lat":41.621419,"lng":1.953935,"ele":668.2},{"lat":41.621417,"lng":1.953936,"ele":668.2},{"lat":41.621431,"lng":1.953902,"ele":667.9},{"lat":41.621389,"lng":1.953888,"ele":667},{"lat":41.621395,"lng":1.953875,"ele":666.9},{"lat":41.621428,"lng":1.95383,"ele":666.8},{"lat":41.621425,"lng":1.953884,"ele":667.6},{"lat":41.62143,"lng":1.9539,"ele":667.9},{"lat":41.621514,"lng":1.954152,"ele":672.6},{"lat":41.621548,"lng":1.954183,"ele":673.2},{"lat":41.621696,"lng":1.954305,"ele":673.4},{"lat":41.621704,"lng":1.954309,"ele":673.2},{"lat":41.621792,"lng":1.954296,"ele":671.6},{"lat":41.621858,"lng":1.954301,"ele":670.3},{"lat":41.621866,"lng":1.954307,"ele":670},{"lat":41.621935,"lng":1.95433,"ele":668.4},{"lat":41.62212,"lng":1.954299,"ele":665.1},{"lat":41.622137,"lng":1.9543,"ele":664.7},{"lat":41.622197,"lng":1.954318,"ele":663.4},{"lat":41.622196,"lng":1.95432,"ele":663.4},{"lat":41.622262,"lng":1.954254