('wikiloc', '253422810', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/4-cursa-de-montanya-de-regencos-2026-quermany-gros-100-cims-de-la-feec-253422810', '4 Cursa de montanya de Regencós 2026 - Quermany Gros ( 100 cims de la FEEC)', '{"en":"Regencós Circular via Mines and Viewpoints","ca":"Circular Regencós per Mines i Miradors","es":"Circular Regencós por Minas y Miradores"}'::jsonb, '4 Cursa de montanya de Regencós 2026 - Quermany Gros ( 100 cims de la FEEC) Hiking trail in Regencós, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Descripció:

